kicad-thermal
Copyright (c) 2026 Christopher Moran

This software is a Rust port of the thermal and DC IR-drop module of kicad_fdtd
(https://github.com/Jerome-Graves/kicad_fdtd, commit 74e21ebe6b87e19a7c709390d0a9661dc8574576),
from which its physical model and algorithms are derived. kicad_fdtd is licensed under the
MIT License, reproduced below. Its copyright and permission notice must be kept in all copies
or substantial portions of this software, under either of this project's licenses
(MIT OR Apache-2.0). The patch in patches/ applies to kicad_fdtd and is under the same terms.

The reference data in tests/reference/ was produced by running kicad_fdtd (with that patch).

